--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Score data: what each scoring item is worth, read from the tiles, boards and rules
-- reference in the mod. Used by Score.ttslua. Pyxis Unity isn't listed (deprecated).
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- VP printed on each sector tile (the shield by the sector number) and its artifacts (the
-- star on the shield's corner; the sparkles on planet squares mark advanced squares, not
-- artifacts). Keyed by the sector number in the tile's Description (HexState_sectorNumber).
